  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "BLUE WHALE beach house vacation rental in gated gulf front cul-de-sac and private beach community. Heated pool. Private beach community. Golf carts allowed.<br><br>Large 6 BEDROOM house in small gated Sunrise Beach Community on south side of30A.<br><br>Breezy beach/ocean views from 2nd and 3rd floor decks. <br><br>Only steps (22) away from the beach and down the boardwalk to your private beach with chairs/umbrellas concierge beach service included. Heated pool available year round <br><br>Only 100 yards down the street from Shunk Gulley in Santa Rosa Beach and many other restaurants and hang outs!! <br><br>The BLUE WHALE sleeps 18 people in 11 individual beds - on the 1st and 3rd floors. No sofa sleepers needed. Open 2nd floor plan living room, kitchen and laundry.<br> Almost 80% of our vacationers are repeat- once you stay at the whale you come back. <br>Golfers welcome! House includes access to private golf courses - Greg Norman’s Sharks Tooth CC , Tom Fazio’s Camp Creek Golf Course and the newest course Davis Love’s “The Third (III)” - the best and most exclusive on the panhandle.<br><br>We have the largest pool in Sunrise beach, measuring 24' x 12'. Very private and not directly in the sun so the kids can swim after a long day at the sun soaked beach. The pool can be heated for $300 per week. <br><br>Relax on the beach- complimentary beach chairs and umbrellas are setup for whole week during prime time months. Our beach service sets it up for you every morning and takes it down every night. <br>The second floor consists of a large great room with adjoining dining room and kitchen. A large dining room table that seats 12 plus 6 stools at the kitchen bar - perfect for everyone to gather for meals or to be together after a day at the beach. Just off the great room is the huge 2nd floor covered porch with plenty of comfortable chairs and a large picnic table to have meals. <br>The third floor has a open deck with plenty of sun for those that don't like the beach or need to stay at the house. <br><br>Three bedrooms and two baths are located on both the first and third floors providing privacy when sharing this beach home with another family. The 2 masters, one on 1st and 3rd floors, have a king bed with a twin bed in the bedroom as well. (Also room for crib or pack-n-play in both masters, not provided by owner.) There are 2 bedrooms with queen beds, one on 1st and 3rd floors. A bedroom on the 3rd has a full size bed with a set of bunkbeds. And the last bedroom is on 1st floor, it has 2 fullsize beds. Mini-kitchens on first and third floors are convenient for private breakfasts or late night snacks. Two charcoal grills to grill your catch!!<br><br>Large porches on all three levels provide the perfect spots to relax in the fragrant gulf breezes as you enjoy the incredible gulf views. Relax beside your large (12-foot by 24-foot), private pool - fenced for your privacy and security - when not on the beach only 25 yards away. The house does not open directly to the pool, you must open a gate to enter pool area. Parking for four cars.<br><br>Pictures tell the story of family reunions or family and friends vacationing together at the beach.<br><br><br>SUMMER Saturday-to-Saturday rental. Sunrise Beach, six bedroom, four-and-one-half bath.<br>SPRING. We are flexible and can’t wait to host your family or friends soon!<br><br>If you have any questions please feel free to call or inquire.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "PRIVATE BEACH ! 6BDRM. Sweeping beach views.Sunrise beach GATED COMMUNITY."
        }
      ],
